        "description": "MRI evidence of cerebral hypoplasia or white matter abnormalities",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: congenital hypopigmentation, ocular anomalies, and neurological deficits",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may support diagnosis but is not definitive; diagnosis primarily clinical."
